dupefinder (2.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Remove duplicate bookmarks in Firefox and Brave (Tools menu or
    dupefinder-cli bookmarks). The oldest copy of each address is kept.
  * Organize bookmarks into topic folders, one folder per website, on the
    toolbar (Firefox) or bookmark bar (Brave). Empty folders are removed.
  * Both change the browser files only while the browser is closed, and
    back the files up first. Firefox records deletions so Sync uploads them.

 -- matthew <firefoxx.ms@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

dupefinder (2.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Similar videos compare frames by pixel correlation, allowing for crops,
    and match when at least 90% of frames agree. Recall on the test clips
    went from about 50% to 97%.
  * The video threshold is now a percentage of matching frames.

 -- matthew <firefoxx.ms@gmail.com>  Tue, 03 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000

